<mxCell id="p0-note" value="Five families: main_catering plus four add-ons: belly_lechon, food_pack, food_tray, pica_pica. One canonical dish; many eligible families/preparations. Typed family defaults replace generic business settings. FK arrows point from dependent to referenced entity. Common keys/types/timestamps and full enforcement details: docs/05-database-entities.md. Phases 1–3 implemented as draft-only; publication and later entities are specifications." style="rounded=1;whiteSpace=wrap;html=1;fillColor=#fefce8;strokeColor=#eab308;fontSize=17;align=left;spacing=15;" vertex="1" parent="1"><mxGeometry x="60" y="1352" width="2170" height="135" as="geometry"/></mxCell>
