<mxCell id="p1-note" value="Snapshot fields are nullable in drafts; required commercial facts are populated before publication. Serving estimate/claim may stay null. Published parents and children are immutable, including child inserts/reparenting. Current pointer must reference same-owner published row. Split rules default to total only; subgroup fields null. Snapshot facts stay frozen; availability remains live. Common keys/types/timestamps and full enforcement details: docs/05-database-entities.md. Specification only; no migrations executed." style="rounded=1;whiteSpace=wrap;html=1;fillColor=#fefce8;strokeColor=#eab308;fontSize=17;align=left;spacing=15;" vertex="1" parent="1"><mxGeometry x="60" y="2141" width="2170" height="135" as="geometry"/></mxCell>
