<mxCell id="p5-note" value="Deny inactive users first; active Admin has full permission access within business invariants. Staff: explicit deny &gt; explicit allow &gt; role grant &gt; deny. Staff publishing/access administration OFF by default. Audit subjects are intentional historical locators, not business FKs. Protect last Admin; revoke stale access. Common keys/types/timestamps and full enforcement details: docs/05-database-entities.md. Specification only; no migrations executed." style="rounded=1;whiteSpace=wrap;html=1;fillColor=#fefce8;strokeColor=#eab308;fontSize=17;align=left;spacing=15;" vertex="1" parent="1"><mxGeometry x="60" y="1277" width="2170" height="135" as="geometry"/></mxCell>
